## Directory-based project format:
.idea/

# Backup files (from futurize)
*.bak

# Memory profiling files
mprofile*.dat
mprofile*.sh
mprofile*.py
src/*.c
_dist
stellarscope/utils/*.c
stellarscope/utils/*.cpp
stellarscope/data/*
!stellarscope/data/alignment.bam
